# Windows Cutover Inventory

Use this inventory during the Windows-facing portion of `Platform-Core` cutover.

## Target Platform Task

- target task name: `{{ platform_windows_task_name }}`
- target distro: `{{ platform_windows_wsl_distro }}`
- rendered bootstrap script:
  - `ansible/generated/openclaw-host-stack-windows-bootstrap.ps1`

## Legacy Windows Tasks

- legacy full-stack task: `{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_stack_task_name }}`
- legacy bridge-only task: `{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_task_name }}`
- legacy bridge repo root: `{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_repo_root }}`

## Discovery Commands

Run on Windows PowerShell before cutover:

- `Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_stack_task_name }}" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue`
- `Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_task_name }}" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue`
- `Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ platform_windows_task_name }}" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue`

## Controlled Cutover Actions

Review before execution.

- Register or refresh the new platform task:
  - `powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ansible/generated/openclaw-host-stack-windows-bootstrap.ps1`
- Disable the legacy full-stack task if it conflicts:
  - `Disable-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_stack_task_name }}"`
- Stop the legacy full-stack task if it is still running:
  - `Stop-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_stack_task_name }}"`
- Disable the legacy bridge-only task if it conflicts:
  - `Disable-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_task_name }}"`
- Stop the legacy bridge-only task if it is still running:
  - `Stop-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_task_name }}"`

## Rollback Actions

Use only if the new path regresses service health.

- Re-enable the legacy full-stack task:
  - `Enable-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_stack_task_name }}"`
- Restart the legacy full-stack task:
  - `Start-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_stack_task_name }}"`
- Re-enable the legacy bridge-only task if needed:
  - `Enable-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_task_name }}"`
- Restart the legacy bridge-only task if needed:
  - `Start-ScheduledTask -TaskName "{{ openclaw_legacy_windows_bridge_task_name }}"`

## Bootstrap Source Of Truth

Use only the platform-managed bootstrap artifact during cutover and after
cleanup:

- `ansible/generated/openclaw-host-stack-windows-bootstrap.ps1`

## Operator Reminder

- disable or stop legacy tasks only during controlled cutover
- record every Windows task change in `ansible/generated/cutover-record/cutover-record.md`
- if rollback is required, restore the previous Windows task path before declaring the migration failed
